message: If you use CyberForge in teaching or research, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "CyberForge: The Open Cybersecurity Lab"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, local-first cybersecurity lab for blue teams, SOC analysts and detection
  engineers: a cyber range, a mini SOC, detection engineering with Sigma, YARA and Suricata,
  MITRE ATT&CK mapping and AI security, all on synthetic data.
